      <dc:creator>Nathan Clay Jamie Lorimer a Stockholm Resilience Centre, Stockholm University, Swedenb Institute of Environmental Science and Technology, Universitat Autònoma de Barcelona, Spainc School of Geography and the Environment, University of Oxford, UKNATHAN CLAY is a Researcher in the Stockholm Resilience Centre at Stockholm University, 106 91 Stockholm, Sweden; and the Institute of Environmental Science and Technology (ICTA-UAB), Universitat Autònoma de Barcelona, 08193 Barcelona, Spain. E-mail: nathan.clay@su.se. He researches environmental governance, climate change, rural livelihoods, and agrifood sustainability transformation.JAMIE LORIMER is a Professor of Environmental Geography at the University of Oxford based in the School of Geography and the Environment and Hertford College, Oxford OX1 3BW, UK. E-mail: Jamie.lorimer@ouce.ox.ac.uk. He researches human–nature relations in a variety of agricultural, conservation, medical, and planetary contexts.</dc:creator>
